### ==========================================
### JDBC CONTROLLERS (RAW JDBC & JDBCTEMPLATE)
### ==========================================

### ------------------------------------------
### 1. ALBUM JDBC CONTROLLERS
### ------------------------------------------

### Create Album (Raw JDBC)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dirt",
  "releaseYear": 1992,
  "artistId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Get All Albums (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw

### Get Album by ID (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw/a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Update Album (Raw JDBC)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw/a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dirt (Remastered)",
  "releaseYear": 1992,
  "artistId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Delete Album (Raw JDBC)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/raw/a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### ---

### Create Album (JdbcTemplate)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/albums/template
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Razdor",
  "releaseYear": 1993,
  "artistId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444"
}

### Get All Albums (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/template

### Get Album by ID (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/template/a4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### Update Album (JdbcTemplate)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/template/a4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Razdor (Deluxe)",
  "releaseYear": 1993,
  "artistId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444"
}

### Delete Album (JdbcTemplate)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/albums/jdbc/template/a4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444


