### 2. ARTIST JDBC CONTROLLERS
### ------------------------------------------

### Create Artist (Raw JDBC)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/artists/raw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice in Chains",
  "country": "United States"
}

### Get All Artists (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artists/raw

### Get Artist by ID (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artists/raw/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Update Artist (Raw JDBC)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/artists/raw/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice in Chains",
  "country": "United States"
}

### Delete Artist (Raw JDBC)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/artists/raw/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### ---

### Create Artist (JdbcTemplate)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/artists/template
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Majke",
  "country": "Croatia"
}

### Get All Artists (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artists/template

### Get Artist by ID (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artists/template/44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### Update Artist (JdbcTemplate)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/artists/template/44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Majke (Updated)",
  "country": "Croatia"
}

### Delete Artist (JdbcTemplate)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/artists/template/44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444


### ------------------------------------------
### 3. TRACK JDBC CONTROLLERS
### ------------------------------------------

### Create Track (Raw JDBC)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Would?",
  "durationSeconds": 207,
  "genreName": "Grunge",
  "albumId": "a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Get All Tracks (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw

### Get Track by ID (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw/11111112-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Update Track (Raw JDBC)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw/11111112-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Would? (Live)",
  "durationSeconds": 215,
  "genreName": "Grunge",
  "albumId": "a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Delete Track (Raw JDBC)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/raw/11111112-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### ---

### Create Track (JdbcTemplate)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Budi ponosan",
  "durationSeconds": 270,
  "genreName": "Garage Rock",
  "albumId": "a4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444"
}

### Get All Tracks (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template

### Get Track by ID (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template/44444441-4444-4444-4444-444444444441

### Update Track (JdbcTemplate)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template/44444441-4444-4444-4444-444444444441
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Budi ponosan (Live)",
  "durationSeconds": 280,
  "genreName": "Garage Rock",
  "albumId": "a4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444"
}

### Delete Track (JdbcTemplate)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/template/44444441-4444-4444-4444-444444444441


### ------------------------------------------
### 4. USER LISTEN HISTORY JDBC CONTROLLERS
### ------------------------------------------

### Create Listen History (Raw JDBC)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/history/raw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999901",
  "trackId": "44444441-4444-4444-4444-444444444441",
  "deviceType": "MOBILE"
}

### Get All Listen History (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/history/raw

### Get Listen History by ID (Raw JDBC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/history/raw/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update Listen History (Raw JDBC)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/history/raw/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999901",
  "trackId": "44444441-4444-4444-4444-444444444441",
  "deviceType": "DESKTOP"
}

### Delete Listen History (Raw JDBC)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/history/raw/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ---

### Create Listen History (JdbcTemplate)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/history/template
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999902",
  "trackId": "44444441-4444-4444-4444-444444444441",
  "deviceType": "MOBILE"
}

### Get All Listen History (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/history/template

### Get Listen History by ID (JdbcTemplate)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/history/template/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update Listen History (JdbcTemplate)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/history/template/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999902",
  "trackId": "44444441-4444-4444-4444-444444444441",
  "deviceType": "TABLET"
}

### Delete Listen History (JdbcTemplate)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/history/template/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### ==========================================
### 5. SPRING DATA JPA CONTROLLERS
### ==========================================

### Get all albums (Spring Data)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/spring-data

### Get album by ID (Spring Data)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/spring-data/a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Create album (Spring Data)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/albums/spring-data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dirt",
  "releaseYear": 1992
}

### ---

### Get all artists (Spring Data)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artists/spring-data

### Search artist by name (Spring Data)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artists/spring-data/search?name=Majke

### ---

### Filter long tracks by genre (Spring Data)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/spring-data/filter?genre=Grunge&minDuration=200


