### 8. QUERYDSL CONTROLLERS
### ==========================================

### Filter long tracks by genre (QueryDSL)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/querydsl?genre=Grunge&minDuration=200

### Get artist engagement metrics (QueryDSL Analytics)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/querydsl?genre=Garage%20Rock&minReleaseYear=1990


